1
00:00:04,963 --> 00:00:05,963
Shit.

2
00:00:06,840 --> 00:00:07,799
What the hell?

3
00:00:07,799 --> 00:00:10,135
He was acting clueless
yesterday.

4
00:00:10,135 --> 00:00:11,261
Was he messing with me?

5
00:00:13,596 --> 00:00:14,840
You studied abroad, right?

6
00:00:14,841 --> 00:00:16,055
Where was it?

7
00:00:16,056 --> 00:00:17,475
Ah, Austria.

8
00:00:17,475 --> 00:00:18,476
Austria.

9
00:00:18,476 --> 00:00:19,602
Hey, freshman.

10
00:00:19,602 --> 00:00:21,438
Your performance was

11
00:00:21,855 --> 00:00:23,815
the best I've seen in years.

12
00:00:23,815 --> 00:00:25,316
Thank you.

13
00:00:38,997 --> 00:00:40,123
Best...

14
00:00:41,624 --> 00:00:42,751
Are you kidding me?

15
00:00:45,712 --> 00:00:46,856
So this is the guy

16
00:00:46,857 --> 00:00:48,062
the professor mentioned.

17
00:00:49,883 --> 00:00:51,032
He must've wanted to

18
00:00:51,033 --> 00:00:52,181
see me sweat.

19
00:00:52,927 --> 00:00:53,927
But that's not happening.

20
00:01:02,145 --> 00:01:04,688
Damn it.

21
00:01:06,066 --> 00:01:07,984
Why isn't he picking up?

22
00:01:18,661 --> 00:01:19,704
That's great.

23
00:01:20,830 --> 00:01:21,830
Keep going.

24
00:01:29,089 --> 00:01:30,131
Wow, you're really good.
